From 47ed4708e2f2902d335e1514726f3cba370bbd53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: StressTestor <212606152+StressTestor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:26:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] avformat/wtvdec: fail on a short read of a legacy attribute
 GUID

get_tag() reads a 16-byte GUID attribute into a stack buffer with
avio_read() and ignores the return value. On a legacy_attrib entry
that is cut inside the GUID, the 16 bytes are never written and the
uninitialised stack contents are formatted with PRI_PRETTY_GUID and
published as a metadata string; ffprobe prints them as e.g.
"TAG:encoder=aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" on a build with
-ftrivial-auto-var-init=pattern.

Use ff_get_guid(), which reads with ffio_read_size() and fails on a
short read, and return without adding the tag, as get_tag() already
does when a string attribute is empty.

Same class as c2394a0ff3 (binka), 29f513af78 (fsb), 4b47405e1c (genh).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: StressTestor <212606152+StressTestor@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit 47ed4708e2f2902d335e1514726f3cba370bbd53)
---
 libavformat/wtvdec.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libavformat/wtvdec.c b/libavformat/wtvdec.c
index adea4d9d39b..e11b00937d0 100644
--- a/libavformat/wtvdec.c
+++ b/libavformat/wtvdec.c
@@ -496,7 +496,8 @@ static void get_tag(AVFormatContext *s, AVIOContext *pb, const char *key, int ty
         snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%u", avio_rl16(pb));
     } else if (type == 6 && length == 16) {
         ff_asf_guid guid;
-        avio_read(pb, guid, 16);
+        if (ff_get_guid(pb, &guid) < 0)
+            return;
         snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), PRI_PRETTY_GUID, ARG_PRETTY_GUID(guid));
     } else if (type == 2 && !strcmp(key, "WM/Picture")) {
         get_attachment(s, pb, length);
-- 
